{"logId": "f83911ab-a2fb-4b95-b043-a70d4bfa3c55", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母、孩子）", "block_bbox": [165, 140, 642, 173], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [642.0, 140.0], [642.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "主题释义：", "block_bbox": [189, 215, 289, 240], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[188.99996948242188, 215.0], [282.9999694824219, 215.0], [282.9999694824219, 239.0], [188.99996948242188, 239.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "家庭是实现幸福生命状态非常重要的一个部分，主要是指父母与孩子之间的亲情关系。不成熟的观念下，很容易造成自身与父母、与孩子上下两代人的束缚和包袱。传统意义上的孝顺和报答、责任与义务，缺乏了对于独立个体的认知和观念，极易形成相互牺牲式的爱或深沉悲壮的爱。先进的文化理念中，父母和子女有各自独立完整的生命，有各自健全的人格。子女不是父母的延续，也不被承载父母的期望，而是自主地主宰和掌控人生。父母给予孩子的是辅助和成就，尽到成年以前必须的养育、教育的义务，塑造正确的人生观、价值观以及生存生活的必要能力。父母与孩子之间应该是相互尊重、独立，彼此不干涉、不依赖、不束缚，轻松自由地各自享受喜欢的生活！", "block_bbox": [193, 263, 1010, 561], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[193.0, 263.0], [1010.0, 263.0], [1010.0, 561.0], [193.0, 561.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[52]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 612, 739], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [611.0, 716.0], [611.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [201, 900, 590, 933], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [590.0, 900.0], [590.0, 933.0], [201.0, 933.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "标准等级：", "block_bbox": [225, 975, 325, 1002], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 975.0], [325.0, 975.0], [325.0, 1002.0], [225.0, 1002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因父母问题造成精神包袱和家庭矛盾。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [225, 1028, 811, 1052], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1028.0], [811.0, 1028.0], [811.0, 1052.0], [225.0, 1052.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "二级【1~2分】：不依附父母，与父母保持良好的沟通、理解和关爱，量力而行地照顾父母生活，整体和睦融洽。（传统）", "block_bbox": [225, 1062, 1044, 1119], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1062.0], [1044.0, 1062.0], [1044.0, 1119.0], [225.0, 1119.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：能够积极理性地寻找有效的方法沟通，彼此达成尊重对方思想观念和生活态度的共识，享受普遍价值观下的亲情状态。（尊重）", "block_bbox": [225, 1129, 1044, 1187], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1129.0], [1044.0, 1129.0], [1044.0, 1187.0], [225.0, 1187.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与父母平等相处的状态。（平等）", "block_bbox": [225, 1196, 1044, 1252], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[225.0, 1196.0], [1044.0, 1196.0], [1044.0, 1252.0], [225.0, 1252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）", "block_bbox": [226, 1263, 997, 1288], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[226.0, 1263.0], [997.0, 1263.0], [997.0, 1288.0], [226.0, 1288.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[53]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.8348464369773865, "coordinate": [165, 140, 642, 173], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 140.0], [642.0, 140.0], [642.0, 173.0], [165.0, 173.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7095519304275513, "coordinate": [189, 215, 289, 240], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[188.99996948242188, 215.0], [282.9999694824219, 215.0], [282.9999694824219, 239.0], [188.99996948242188, 239.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9589636325836182, "coordinate": [193, 263, 1010, 561], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[193.0, 263.0], [1010.0, 263.0], [1010.0, 561.0], [193.0, 561.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6471852660179138, "coordinate": [573, 716, 612, 739], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [611.0, 716.0], [611.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.46922293305397034, "coordinate": [201, 900, 590, 933], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 900.0], [590.0, 900.0], [590.0, 933.0], [201.0, 933.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6587885022163391, "coordinate": [225, 975, 325, 1002], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[225.0, 975.0], [325.0, 975.0], [325.0, 1002.0], [225.0, 1002.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8010959625244141, "coordinate": [225, 1028, 811, 1052], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[225.0, 1028.0], [811.0, 1028.0], [811.0, 1052.0], [225.0, 1052.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8814851641654968, "coordinate": [225, 1062, 1044, 1119], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[225.0, 1062.0], [1044.0, 1062.0], [1044.0, 1119.0], [225.0, 1119.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9133098125457764, "coordinate": [225, 1129, 1044, 1187], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[225.0, 1129.0], [1044.0, 1129.0], [1044.0, 1187.0], [225.0, 1187.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9069502949714661, "coordinate": [225, 1196, 1044, 1252], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[225.0, 1196.0], [1044.0, 1196.0], [1044.0, 1252.0], [225.0, 1252.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8220986723899841, "coordinate": [226, 1263, 997, 1288], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[226.0, 1263.0], [997.0, 1263.0], [997.0, 1288.0], [226.0, 1288.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6938068270683289, "coordinate": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母、孩子）\n\n## 主题释义：\n\n家庭是实现幸福生命状态非常重要的一个部分，主要是指父母与孩子之间的亲情关系。不成熟的观念下，很容易造成自身与父母、与孩子上下两代人的束缚和包袱。传统意义上的孝顺和报答、责任与义务，缺乏了对于独立个体的认知和观念，极易形成相互牺牲式的爱或深沉悲壮的爱。先进的文化理念中，父母和子女有各自独立完整的生命，有各自健全的人格。子女不是父母的延续，也不被承载父母的期望，而是自主地主宰和掌控人生。父母给予孩子的是辅助和成就，尽到成年以前必须的养育、教育的义务，塑造正确的人生观、价值观以及生存生活的必要能力。父母与孩子之间应该是相互尊重、独立，彼此不干涉、不依赖、不束缚，轻松自由地各自享受喜欢的生活！\n\n[52]\n\n## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n## 标准等级：\n\n一级【0~1分】：不因父母问题造成精神包袱和家庭矛盾。（底线原则）\n\n二级【1~2分】：不依附父母，与父母保持良好的沟通、理解和关爱，量力而行地照顾父母生活，整体和睦融洽。（传统）\n\n三级【2~3分】：能够积极理性地寻找有效的方法沟通，彼此达成尊重对方思想观念和生活态度的共识，享受普遍价值观下的亲情状态。（尊重）\n\n四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与父母平等相处的状态。（平等）\n\n五级【4~5分】：彼此尊重、彼此独立、没有束缚和包袱，各自活好自己阳光的生命。（自由）", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f83911ab-a2fb-4b95-b043-a70d4bfa3c55/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A28Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe1c82ae1b56369a4ea74d6984770d952732b7b26955215aeefc056d070e99295"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f83911ab-a2fb-4b95-b043-a70d4bfa3c55/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A28Z%2F-1%2F%2F14054b8dab7de2d9c6043a40b19b76535752469cd54afaf441740d24768fe2cf"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f83911ab-a2fb-4b9